  "version": "25.07.1",
  "transcribed": "2026-09-23",
  "notes": "Transcribed from source, not captured from a running editor. Serialization follows helix-lsp-types serde attributes: None options are skipped, except rootUri which serializes as null when absent; a Some(Default) struct serializes as {} (completionItemKind). Runtime-dependent values chosen: editor config lsp.snippets = true (default), so completionItem.snippetSupport is true; no `config` key in the language-server configuration, so initializationOptions is absent; an LSP root was found (root marker / workspace), so rootUri is set and workspaceFolders holds one folder named after the root's basename (with no root, rootUri is null, workspaceFolders is [] and rootPath falls back to the workspace directory). rootPath is the root path string (no trailing slash). clientInfo.version is VERSION_AND_GIT_HASH, which is '25.07.1' for a build without git metadata (a build from a git checkout appends ' (<8-char hash>)'). trace, locale and workDoneToken are None and therefore absent. processId is std::process::id() in reality; null here per fixture convention.",
